{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> \ud83c\udf31 About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WildRoot is a cozy colony-life sim where you build, farm,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> craft, and grow alongside a small group of settlers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> There\u2019s no harsh fail state, no punishing mechanics\u2014just a warm,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> relaxing experience where your choices shape the rhythm and personality of your little community.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start with a handful of colonists, gather resources,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> build structures, grow crops, cook meals, craft tools, decorate your settlement,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> and explore the surrounding wilderness. WildRoot mixes the chill daily-life feel of </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Stardew Valley with the colony-management depth of RimWorld\u2014without the stress or brutality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3e Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfe1 Build Your Dream Settlement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design and expand your colony the way you like. Create workstations, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>kitchens, bedrooms, farms, workshops, crafting rooms, cozy taverns,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> or quiet study spaces. Every room you build gives bonuses and new gameplay options.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446730/extras/86741ba081bf9551567c8881aeddc569.poster.avif?t=1773096699\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446730/extras/86741ba081bf9551567c8881aeddc569.webm?t=1773096699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446730/extras/86741ba081bf9551567c8881aeddc569.mp4?t=1773096699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Deep, Relaxing Farming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow dozens of crops with their own needs\u2014temperature, water, soil quality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colonists plant seeds, water them, harvest them, and store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> them automatically depending on their tasks and schedules.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crops can wither if temperatures get too extreme, so planning and seasons matter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf73 Cooking &amp; Crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Process ingredients into meals your colonists love.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft tools, furniture, decorations, and gear.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade stations to unlock new recipes and production chains.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddcd Colonists With Personality</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every colonist has moods, traits, likes, dislikes, relationships, and daily routines.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friends help each other. Lovers sleep together and get mood boosts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breakups, friendships, rivalries\u2014it all emerges naturally.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446730/extras/bc33680ae87838e3accffbdb1cf0e1e9.poster.avif?t=1773096699\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446730/extras/bc33680ae87838e3accffbdb1cf0e1e9.webm?t=1773096699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446730/extras/bc33680ae87838e3accffbdb1cf0e1e9.mp4?t=1773096699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f A Living Environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather shifts between rain, snow, heatwaves, cold snaps, storms, and peaceful sunny days.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasons change how your colony plays\u2014winter requires storage, while spring is great for farming.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446730/extras/b69bff3e4a992b1141fbed1ab9d275f1.poster.avif?t=1773096699\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446730/extras/b69bff3e4a992b1141fbed1ab9d275f1.webm?t=1773096699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446730/extras/b69bff3e4a992b1141fbed1ab9d275f1.mp4?t=1773096699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3e Wildlife &amp; Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore forests, lakesides, and meadows.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different biomes have different animals, resources, and surprises.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animals interact with your colony based on hunger, territory, and weather.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udded Chill Gameplay With Soft Consequences</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WildRoot avoids frustrating, punitive systems.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your colony won\u2019t collapse because of one mistake.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low mood means settlers relax, eat, or wander until they feel better.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything nudges you, not punishes you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Decorate &amp; Make It Yours</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place furniture, carpets, plants, lamps, and cute collectibles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a colony that feels alive, cozy, and uniquely yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf42 Why WildRoot?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s made by a solo dev who wanted a peaceful alternative to hardcore </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>colony sims\u2014something warm, cozy, and welcoming.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A game where progress feels satisfying, failures aren\u2019t brutal, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>and the world gently reacts to how you grow it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you enjoy relaxed management, chill farming, mood-based colonists,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> or building aesthetic settlements, WildRoot is built exactly for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3446730?t=1773096699","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3446730?t=1773096699","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/34467