her. Lovers sleep together and get mood boosts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breakups, friendships, rivalries\u2014it all emerges naturally.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446730/extras/bc33680ae87838e3accffbdb1cf0e1e9.poster.avif?t=1773096699\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446730/extras/bc33680ae87838e3accffbdb1cf0e1e9.webm?t=1773096699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446730/extras/bc33680ae87838e3accffbdb1cf0e1e9.mp4?t=1773096699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f A Living Environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather shifts between rain, snow, heatwaves, cold snaps, storms, and peaceful sunny days.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasons change how your colony plays\u2014winter requires storage, while spring is great for farming.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446730/extras/b69bff3e4a992b1141fbed1ab9d275f1.poster.avif?t=1773096699\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446730/extras/b69bff3e4a992b1141fbed1ab9d275f1.webm?t=1773096699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446730/extras/b69bff3e4a992b1141fbed1ab9d275f1.mp4?t=1773096699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3e Wildlife &amp; Exploration</strong></p><p cla